OL,3,GNEWSAPower deal between Labour and
OL,4,AGreens in Sheffield
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Labour on Sheffield City
OL,7,FCouncil has said a deal would be
OL,8,Fannounced in coming days about
OL,9,Fcontinuing a power-sharing deal with
OL,10,Fthe Green Party.
OL,12,FIt came after a bitter row over
OL,13,FZionism, which saw Labour nationally
OL,14,Ftelling 11 councils, including
OL,15,FSheffield, to break power deals with
OL,16,Fthe Greens.
OL,18,FUntil this afternoon's council meeting,
OL,19,Fit had been expected that Labour would
OL,20,Fmove to run matters in the city on its
OL,21,Fown, by ditching power-sharing with the
OL,22,FGreens.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
