OL,3,GNEWSAPower deal between Labour and
OL,4,AGreens in Sheffield
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking to a delayed full council
OL,7,Fmeeting, Labour leader Fran Belbin said
OL,8,Ftalks had been going on, and a joint
OL,9,Fstatement would be made "in coming
OL,10,Fdays" to show they could continue the
OL,11,Fcurrent administration.
